# The object database stores LF; each working tree gets its own platform's endings on checkout,
# so a Windows and a macOS clone produce identical blobs from identical edits. Declaring it here
# rather than in local config means every clone inherits it instead of relying on core.autocrlf.
* text=auto

# The display face is binary. Never line-ending-normalise it, and never try to diff it as text.
*.woff2 binary
